      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to introduce this fantastic two -bedroom End of terrace property to the market in the ever-popular location of Abbotstown Drive in Finglas, Dublin 11.\nNo. 11 Abbotstown Avenue is ideally located within walking distance to Finglas Village which has a wide array of shops, bars and restaurants. The Botanic Gardens, IKEA, and DCU are other amenities and facilities close by to mention but a few. There are excellent road networks including the M50 to bring you in and around Dublin City and an excellent bus service. No. 11 is also within an excellent catchment of both primary and secondary schools.\nBright and spacious living accommodation of c. 60 sqm comprises of entrance hallway, living room to front, kitchen and dining area all located downstairs. Upstairs hosts 2 generous bedrooms and a family bathroom. To the rear, there is a large rear garden. No 11 is coming to the market in excellent condition throughout and benefits gas fired central heating, Double glazed windows, quality flooring throughout and a generous rear garden.\nThe properties new owner will have the opportunity to lay down roots in one of Dublin 11s most sought after and family-oriented locations. An opportunity not to be missed: call Ray Cooke Auctioneers on 086 0469458 or 01 6995050 today for further information or to arrange viewing!!\n\nAdditional Features:\n• c. 60 sq.m\n• BER G\n• End of Terrace\n• 2 Bed 1 Bath\n• Large Rear garden\n• Double Glazed windows\n• Gas fired central heating\n• Only 15 minutes' drive to Dublin Airport\n• Within easy reach of M50 & N2 motorways\n• Excellent primary and secondary schools in the area\n• Bus routes to City Centre closeby\n• Within walking distance of Finglas Village\n• Ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike\n• Early Viewing is highly advised!!"
      },
      {
